# ==============================================================================
# LINGUALLY — Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
# Lingually is 100% Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) and local-first!
# In ordinary usage, NO environment variables are required. Users enter their
# own API keys securely in the browser Settings UI.
#
# Optional overrides for self-hosted instances:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
# NODE_ENV=development
